# Application and file lifecycle.
#
# Generated from tests/test_dfc_virtual_picc_lifecycle_vectors.c by recording the
# exchanges the reference engine performed, then cross-checked: all 28 byte
# expectations asserted by that test matched the recording exactly. The extra
# steps are the two D40 authentication handshakes, which the source performs via
# a helper and asserts only by status.
#
# The engine's default RndB generator (00 01 02 ...) makes authentication
# deterministic, which is what allows these to be literal bytes.
#
# Re-recorded when access-rights refusals were split from wrong-object
# refusals. Only the read after ChangeFileSettings set the rights to 0x0000
# moved, from 0x9D to 0xAE; the other 33 recorded steps were byte-identical to
# the previous recording.

